Package: quantway
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Pre-Depends: python3-minimal (>= 3.9)
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.6), gir1.2-glib-2.0, libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.72) | libglib2.0-0t64 (>= 2.72), librsvg2-common, adwaita-icon-theme, pkexec | policykit-1, polkitd | policykit-1, iproute2, nftables, systemd-resolved | systemd (>= 249), systemd-resolved | systemd (<< 250), ca-certificates, xdg-utils
Recommends: gnome-keyring, dbus-user-session, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Homepage: https://qntw.link
Description: Quantway desktop VPN client
 Native GTK application for Quantway accounts and external VPN subscriptions.
 Supports ordinary VPN connections and the separate Tinc client mode.
 Administrator authorization is requested when connecting, while account
 sessions use the desktop Secret Service when available.
